  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's combined perception and motion capabilities, capturing all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification automata E1-E4 encode safe and coverage-biased exploration: E1 binds clear perception to forward/random_walk actions, E2 and E3 enforce directed turn recovery for left/right obstacles, and E4 enforces conservative backward-then-turn recovery for front obstacles. The design ensures the robot spends most time exploring, recovers efficiently, and never chains backward or scan actions.",
